     "date": "2026-08-16T11:00:19Z"
    },
    "message": "feat(rtk): token-optimizer dashboard card + desktop tray toggles\n\nPart 2 of 2. Adds the RTK management surfaces, all driving the same ~/.fcc/rtk.json\nand apply_rtk_state reconciler shipped in v5.20.0.\n\n- Admin: GET/POST /admin/api/rtk (loopback-guarded). GET returns rtk_status() +\n  persisted state; POST persists then reconciles the machine (RTK is a\n  machine-global tool, so it reconciles unlike the persist-only desktop prefs).\n- Dashboard: a \"Token optimizer\" card (three toggles + status line) bound to the\n  new endpoints, reusing the flat+dense card + .toggle-control patterns.\n- Desktop tray: a \"Token optimizer\" submenu with three checkable items\n  (Claude Code / Codex / Pi) that toggle state and reconcile.\n\nAll three surfaces (CLI, dashboard, tray) read/write the same file and call the\nsame reconciler, so a toggle anywhere is reflected everywhere.\n\nVerification: 12 new tests + full suite 4061 passed / 6 pre-existing PS-installer\nfailures (baseline unchanged); ruff format/check + ty clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
